WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hello, and welcome to StoryCast.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
I never thought my story could inspire someone else.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
But when I started sharing, I realized
that my experiences belong to a bigger story.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.500
I used to be afraid of speaking.
Then someone listened.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Now I tell my story so that others
know they are not alone.